m burns the after-things away and leaves nothing but the root. The root would fight forever. This is the series engine for Book 2 (corruption ladder: Red use \u2192 memory loss \u2192 root-only \u2192 husk). (4) THE PIT AS RING. The pit is not a holding-pen (ch27) \u2014 it is an arena. The running-chain, the gallery, the massed throats, the betting faces above. The boy is deployed, not caged. The pit-fight is the first action set-piece of the blood-city that Book 2 is set in. (5) THE PATRON RECALCULATES. The patron sees the warm from the gallery and the pale eyes go bright \u2014 the bright of a thing that has seen a number it did not expect. The pricing has changed. The patron says MORE. This is the Book 2 engine: the patron will put him in the ring again and again because the ring is where the warm comes up. (6) THE THREE-LAYER ARCHITECTURE. The wrongness/root (survival-core, island-made), the warm (the Red, heritage, under the root), and the still place (after-things, Kala-made) \u2014 three things in the dark room of the boy's chest, each breathing at its own pace, none matching. This is the deepest expression of the book's central architecture. (7) THE FIVE COUNTS. At chapter's end: the boy counts, the wrongness counts, the warm breathes, the Kala breathes (three levels up), the big one breathes (one level up), Marrow breathes (two cells down), the bold heart beats. Five+ living things counting in the dark under a city that does not know they are counting. The belonging-spine survives the pit. (8) CLIFFHANGER VOW. The hand opens. The cage opened on the ship and the green made him. The cage opened on the island and the tribe made him. The cage would open here. Not despair \u2014 a vow. This is the Book 1 ending the outline demands. Structural plants: warm-as-weapon (new deepest layer), warm-touches-other (Sanderson new power), memory-cost (Sanderson new limitation), patron recalculates (Book 2 engine), eye-and-thorn on every wall (Book 2 blood-city connection),